BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-11-20T11:59:00&endDate=2026-11-21T20:30:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nTUBE STRIKE: Piccadilly line service control staff are planning to take strike action from Friday 20 until Saturday evening 21 November. There will be no service from midday on Friday until Saturday evening\, including Night Tube on Friday night. Normal Night Tube service is expected to operate on Saturday night. Due to shared infrastructure around the Ealing Common District line depot\, there will be no DISTRICT LINE service between Turnham Green and Ealing Broadway from midday on Friday until Saturday evening. Replacement buses will operate during Friday Night Tube hours and Saturday daytime only. Please use ELIZABETH LINE services for travel between Central London and Heathrow\, and between terminals\, and METROPOLITAN LINE services between Rayners Lane and Uxbridge.
DTEND:20261121T203000Z
DTSTART:20261120T115900Z
SUMMARY:Piccadilly: Planned Closure
UID:6145c17a-bdf2-4091-b78f-0b38c61e930c@6145.org
END:VEVENT
